=2 Walkthrough
>Mount Zhayolm
!Mount Zhayolm-map.jpg||Mount Zhayolm map
* Speak with {n:Ghatsad} in the **Automaton Workshop** (I-7) in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} HP #1 for a cutscene.
** You will receive a {@k} {k:Gift for Megomak}.
* Head to {z:Mount Zhayolm} (I-9) via the {p:Halvung Staging Point}.
* For the next step, you will need the {@k} {k:Cast metal plate} permanent Key Item.
* Head to the **Gates of Halvung** near the {p:Halvung Staging Point} at (J-7) and open it with the {@k} {k:Cast metal plate}.
* Go through the gate you just opened and head southwest. Find the ramp at the central part of (I-8) and go up. Head west then south to reach the **Acid-eaten Door** at (I-9 NW corner). Click it for a cutscene.
** You will lose the {@k} {k:Gift for Megomak}.
* Proceed to {z:Hazhalm Testing Grounds} in {z:Caedarva Mire} ({p:Einherjar}'s location) and examine the **Entry Gate** for a cutscene.
** Fastest route is {z:Caedarva Mire} {p:Home Point} #1.
* Head back outside to {z:Caedarva Mire} and examine the **Vexing Sniffles** (E-10) (Graveyard, outside of Hazhalm zone) for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Vexing Sniffles** once more to begin a confrontation against {m:Gloom Phantom} (WAR/DRK), {m:Magh Bihu} (MNK), and {m:Dazbog} (PLD).
** Approximately 60k HP each.
** Mnejing will assist and must be kept alive.
*** You will receive a {@k} {k:Pure white ampoule} after the fight.
* Examine the **Vexing Sniffles** a final time for a cutscene.
* Return to the **Acid-eaten Door** in {z:Mount Zhayolm} at (I-9) for a cutscene.
** You will lose the {@k} {k:Pure white ampoule}.
* Return to {n:Ghatsad} (I-7) in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} for the final cutscene and your reward.

